{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>大公文匯位於興偉中心的辦公室接可疑粉末信件。</figcaption></figure><p>繼《香港01》，再有傳媒機構接到可疑粉末信件。今日(21日)傍晚6時許，警方接報，指香港仔田灣海傍道興偉中心3樓辦公室的職員拆信時，發現可疑信件，內裝有可疑粉末。據了解，上址3層為「大公文匯全媒體新聞中心」。警方到場調查，案件暫列「求警協助」跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T13:21:50.536319+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T12:23:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T20:18:00.050812+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T13:17:49.088781+00:00","content_hash":"1b7812a8f03d46ab44a343f068b81c958f39f035430300f059be1f5f19d3c5ea","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}